From: MedyMa <75345465+MedyMa@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: adapt MediaTek EIP inline secpath and QDMA support

Based on official MediaTek b1a72ada, 9bdd02a0 and 6c132901. Preserve
Linux policy checks, explicit skb ownership and HNAT accounting fences.

